   },
   {
    "by": "rosa-lindqvist",
    "text": "Even the warm-up gives me chills.",
    "ago": "5h"
   },
   {
    "by": "jonah-bell",
    "text": "Old ballrooms and boleros. Correct pairing.",
    "ago": "8h"
   }
  ],
  "ic-nova-stage": [
   {
    "by": "amara-diallo",
    "text": "I could hear it from the bar. Loudest crowd of the year.",
    "ago": "2h"
   },
   {
    "by": "theo-okafor",
    "text": "I was the one screaming the bridge. Sorry not sorry.",
    "ago": "2h"
   },
   {
    "by": "nova-lin",
    "text": "you were perfect. all of you.",
    "ago": "3h"
   },
   {
    "by": "elliot-park",
    "text": "Still can’t hear properly. Worth it.",
    "ago": "7h"
   },
   {
    "by": "sofia-reyes",
    "text": "Best night of my year and it’s November.",
    "ago": "9h"
   }
  ],
  "ic-dex-packing-up": [
   {
    "by": "theo-okafor",
    "text": "Same chair every night is the most jazz sentence ever written.",
    "ago": "1h"
   },
   {
    "by": "dex-holloway",
    "text": "the chair has seniority.",
    "ago": "3h"
   },
   {
    "by": "jonah-bell",
    "text": "Same chair, same magic.",
    "ago": "3h"
   },
   {
    "by": "amara-diallo",
    "text": "The 1am set is a religious experience.",
    "ago": "6h"
   },
   {
    "by": "sofia-reyes",
    "text": "Caught you here last spring. Still thinking about it.",
    "ago": "1d"
   }
  ],
  "ic-ines-close": [
   {
    "by": "sofia-reyes",
    "text": "Scales never sounded this good at 7am.",
    "ago": "1h"
   },
   {
    "by": "maya-chen",
    "text": "The discipline. I can’t even wake up for breakfast.",
    "ago": "2h"
   },
   {
    "by": "rosa-lindqvist",
    "text": "The tone on that violin.",
    "ago": "3h"
   },
   {
    "by": "ines-moreau",
    "text": "the scales are the quiet part of the day. I love them.",
    "ago": "4h"
   },
   {
    "by": "priya-nair",
    "text": "Ten minutes of this would fix my whole week.",
    "ago": "10h"
   }
  ],
  "ic-ines-case": [
   {
    "by": "sofia-reyes",
    "text": "Abuelo would be proud.",
    "ago": "1h"
   },
   {
    "by": "ines-moreau",
    "text": "he would ask why it took me so long.",
    "ago": "3h"
   },
   {
    "by": "rosa-lindqvist",
    "text": "Abuelo would be so proud.",
    "ago": "3h"
   },
   {
    "by": "amara-diallo",
    "text": "Instruments with history sound different. You can hear it.",
    "ago": "7h"
   },
   {
    "by": "jonah-bell",
    "text": "Can’t wait to hear it on the record.",
    "ago": "1d"
   }
  ],
  "ic-sola-setup": [
   {
    "by": "amara-diallo",
    "text": "The venue power held. Barely. Best night of the year.",
    "ago": "1h"
   },
   {
    "by": "elliot-park",
    "text": "Pink Hour at 3:58 was unreal.",
    "ago": "3h"
   },
   {
    "by": "jonah-bell",
    "text": "A lot of trust in the venue’s power. Never relatable before tonight.",
    "ago": "3h"
   },
   {
    "by": "rosa-lindqvist",
    "text": "Two decks, zero panic. Legend.",
    "ago": "7h"
   },
   {
    "by": "sola",
    "text": "the power held. barely.",
    "ago": "9h"
   }
  ],
  "ic-sola-decks": [
   {
    "by": "maya-chen",
    "text": "Stayed till 4. No regrets.",
    "ago": "1h"
   },
   {
    "by": "elliot-park",
    "text": "Stayed till 4, would stay till 6.",
    "ago": "2h"
   },
   {
    "by": "sola",
    "text": "you were the loud ones at the front, weren’t you.",
    "ago": "3h"
   },
   {
    "by": "amara-diallo",
    "text": "That closing track. What WAS that?",
    "ago": "5h"
   },
   {
    "by": "theo-okafor",
    "text": "My legs still haven’t forgiven me.",
    "ago": "1d"
   }
  ],
  "ic-salon-drums": [
   {
    "by": "priya-nair",
    "text": "The chandeliers definitely approved.",
    "ago": "1h"
   },
   {
    "by": "salon-azul",
    "text": "the chandeliers have since filed a complaint",
    "ago": "1h"
   },
   {
    "by": "theo-okafor",
    "text": "Rubén is a menace in the best way.",
    "ago": "3h"
   },
   {
    "by": "sofia-reyes",
    "text": "Rubén is a national treasure.",
    "ago": "4h"
   },
   {
    "by": "jonah-bell",
    "text": "That groove in a room like this. Unreal.",
    "ago": "8h"
   }
  ],
  "ic-arden-take": [
   {
    "by": "rosa-lindqvist",
    "text": "Take four is the one. Trust me.",
    "ago": "1h"
   },
   {
    "by": "arden-strings",
    "text": "take four is on the album. don’t tell take five.",
    "ago": "2h"
   },
   {
    "by": "elliot-park",
    "text": "The cello line in this. I’m done.",
    "ago": "5h"
   },
   {
    "by": "maya-chen",
    "text": "Stopped counting, started crying.",
    "ago": "9h"
   }
  ],
  "ic-lucia-log": [
   {
    "by": "maya-chen",
    "text": "Please release the log version.",
    "ago": "1h"
   },
   {
    "by": "lucia-paz",
    "text": "the log gets a writing credit.",
    "ago": "3h"
   },
   {
    "by": "jonah-bell",
    "text": "The best songs are always found, not written.",
    "ago": "3h"
   },
   {
    "by": "rosa-lindqvist",
    "text": "Of course the log had a song in it.",
    "ago": "6h"
   },
   {
    "by": "elliot-park",
    "text": "Fingerpicking on a log. Austin, never change.",
    "ago": "1d"
   }
  ],
  "ic-aurelio-practice": [
   {
    "by": "rosa-lindqvist",
    "text": "Clara and that upright. Perfect.",
    "ago": "1h"
   },
   {
    "by": "maya-chen",
    "text": "Clara and the old upright. Perfect pairing.",
    "ago": "2h"
   },
   {
    "by": "aurelio-fen",
    "text": "she taught me this piece. it’s hers really.",
    "ago": "4h"
   },
   {
    "by": "sofia-reyes",
    "text": "I could listen to this rehearsal on repeat.",
    "ago": "9h"
   }
  ],
  "ic-canal-room": [
   {
    "by": "jonah-bell",
    "text": "That room has the best echo in the city.",
    "ago": "1h"
   },
   {
    "by": "canal-street-brass",
    "text": "the graffiti is our fifth member",
    "ago": "2h"
   },
   {
    "by": "amara-diallo",
    "text": "Practice room energy is undefeated.",
    "ago": "6h"
   },
   {
    "by": "theo-okafor",
    "text": "Sounds like a second line already.",
    "ago": "10h"
   }
  ],
  "ic-marisol-room": [
   {
    "by": "priya-nair",
    "text": "You can hear the room breathing. Record everything here.",
    "ago": "2h"
   },
   {
    "by": "marisol-vega",
    "text": "we are. every note of the new one.",
    "ago": "3h"
   },
   {
    "by": "elliot-park",
    "text": "The natural reverb on this is unreal.",
    "ago": "7h"
   },
   {
    "by": "maya-chen",
    "text": "Studios hate this one trick.",
    "ago": "10h"
   }
  ],
  "ic-dex-fog": [
   {
    "by": "theo-okafor",
    "text": "This looks like a dream I had once.",
    "ago": "1h"
   },
   {
    "by": "dex-holloway",
    "text": "the smoke machine has opinions",
    "ago": "2h"
   },
   {
    "by": "elliot-park",
    "text": "One more take is never one more take.",
    "ago": "5h"
   },
   {
    "by": "rosa-lindqvist",
    "text": "The silhouette! Frame it.",
    "ago": "8h"
   }
  ],
  "ic-arden-silhouette": [
   {
    "by": "sofia-reyes",
    "text": "Lights off is the only way to play strings. Agree.",
    "ago": "1h"
   },
   {
    "by": "theo-okafor",
    "text": "The last pass is always the honest one.",
    "ago": "4h"
   },
   {
    "by": "arden-strings",
    "text": "it’s the only time we stop thinking",
    "ago": "6h"
   },
   {
    "by": "priya-nair",
    "text": "This is the mood for my entire winter.",
    "ago": "11h"
   }
  ],
  "ic-salon-bass": [
   {
    "by": "theo-okafor",
    "text": "New strings smell. You can hear it.",
    "ago": "2h"
   },
   {
    "by": "priya-nair",
    "text": "The low end on my headphones right now. Wow.",
    "ago": "5h"
   },
   {
    "by": "salon-azul",
    "text": "the old bass says thank you",
    "ago": "7h"
   },
   {
    "by": "maya-chen",
    "text": "Bass players deserve more posts like this.",
    "ago": "1d"
   }
  ]
 },
